			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 100070101,
					"content": "...I'll take that as a yes, then.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070102,
					"content": "Venti?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100070103,
					"content": "#Ah, finally! You're here, {NICKNAME}! Do you have a message for me from someone, by any chance?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070104,
						100070105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070104,
					"content": "A message?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100070106,
					"content": "There's not a single prophecy about you in that dictionary.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070107,
					"content": "That's what you were about to say, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070108,
						100070109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070108,
					"content": "Yeah.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100070110,
					"content": "#Oh? Just a moment, {NICKNAME}.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070111,
					"content": "Hmm... Your curiosity seems as strong as ever, Barbeloth. Alas, my \"future\" will have to remain absent from your dictionary.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070112,
					"content": "The wind may be happy to let dandelions trace its form, and have poets sing it into verse, but to be contained is hardly its nature.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070113,
					"content": "So, dear Barbeloth, please do set your pen down. Words heard on the wind are not meant to be recorded on the page.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070114,
					"content": "If you're truly interested in this legend, allow me to fashion it into a poem. I'll be sure to share it with you ladies at our next tea party.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070115,
					"content": "Barbeloth? She...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070116
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100070116,
					"content": "Hahaha, Barbeloth has always been a reasonable person, and I believe she heard my request.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070117,
					"content": "As such, our conversation should be free from interruptions for now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070118,
					"content": "Wait, Barbeloth was listening in just now? P—Paimon didn't notice a thing...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070119,
					"content": "Well, she is a Hexenzirkel mage. They all have quite a few tricks up their sleeves.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070120,
					"content": "Still, you noticed right away, and even got her to leave us alone. Doesn't that make you the real master at cards here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070121,
					"content": "Hmm... Given the various practical factors at play, I'd call myself a master — with limits.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070122,
					"content": "There you go, being all secretive again. Well, anyway, there wasn't a single thing about you in that dictionary.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070123,
						100070124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070123,
					"content": "Yeah, she just...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070125
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100070125,
					"content": "You being here is enough. Barbeloth's \"prophecy\" concerning me may be \"incomplete,\" but it's not \"incorrect.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070126,
					"content": "There's something I need to do, and I could indeed use your help.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070127,
						100070128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070127,
					"content": "What is it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070129
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100070129,
					"content": "Hehe, trusty as always. In that case...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070130,
					"content": "#Could you play a song with me later, {NICKNAME}?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070131,
						100070132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070131,
					"content": "Huh? I mean, sure...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070133
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100070133,
					"content": "Yep. That's all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070134,
					"content": "But, don't worry. This isn't a performance to decide the fate of some consequential event... It's just a duet between friends.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070135,
					"content": "The last time I played this song, the howling gale was my sole audience, and the notes scattered in all directions, leaving only fragments of the melody behind.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070136,
					"content": "But now, with a friend like you by my side, why should the wind alone bear witness to this music?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070137,
					"content": "Besides, I think my hands will be just that much steadier, playing alongside a trusty friend like you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070138
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070138,
					"content": "I'll play the best I can.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070139
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100070139,
					"content": "That's all I ask. Now, let's head to the performance venue. If we follow the breeze, we'll be there in no time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 100070132,
					"content": "But is that all you need me to do?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070133
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100070128,
					"content": "You can count on me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070129
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100070124,
					"content": "Told me to come here and wait.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070125
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100070109,
					"content": "The mages wanted me to come see you anyway, though.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100070105,
					"content": "Actually, um...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100070106
					]
				}
			]
		},
